-# UI Specialist Gate Final Audit: APPROVED for KANBA-103 (KB-P3-15)
-
-- Auditor: ui-specialist (Swarm UI & UX Architecture Specialist Gate)
-- Worktree: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-103`
